  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14212968/assets/d486581ea48bc96adc1269fbf40d1d71a547e92977f71e3a74336a147ef9b222.png)\n\nA potato $P$ is fired from a cannon $C$ at an angle of $\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ radians from the horizontal. The horizontal distance the projectile travels increases at a rate of $18\\,\\text{m}/\\text{s}.$ If the angle of elevation does not change, what is the speed of the potato?",
